# Serve the catalog at the site root.
#
# Pages serves `index.html` at `/`, and this site has none, so the
# bundle would 404 there on its own. A `200` rule proxies the root to
# the file, which is why kage's `CATALOG_URL` is the bare origin:
#
#     https://models.kage.qaidvoid.dev/
#
# `200` rather than a `302` so the client gets the catalog in one
# request with no redirect hop to follow.
/ /models.json 200
